<title>PORTUGAL: Competition for Quimigal sale opens early 97-paper.</title>
<headline>Competition for Quimigal sale opens early 97-paper.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Under-Secretary for Finance Fernando Teixeira dos Santos told a Lisbon newspaper that he expected the government would open a public competition on the privatisation of chemical company Quimigal in early 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;We are working on the specifications of the privatisation of Quimigal and we expect to open the competition at the beginning of the year (1997),&quot; Teixeira dos Santos told Diario de Noticias newspaper in an interview.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- David Brough, Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
